@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: RAG Bot Evaluation Pipeline

actor User
participant "evaluate.py" as Eval
participant "query_logger.py" as Logger
participant "rag_pipeline.py" as RAG
participant "faiss_index.py" as FAISS
database "FAISS Index" as Index
participant "Ollama LLM" as LLM
database "logs/query_log.jsonl" as Log
database "evaluation_report.json" as Report

User -> Eval: Run evaluation on golden set
activate Eval

loop For each question in golden_questions.json
    Eval -> Logger: ask_and_log(query)
    activate Logger
    
    Logger -> RAG: ask(query, n_results=5)
    activate RAG
    
    RAG -> FAISS: search(query, n_results=5)
    activate FAISS
    
    FAISS -> Index: Embed query & k-NN search
    activate Index
    
    alt Chunks found (index has data)
        Index --> FAISS: top-k chunks with metadata
        deactivate Index
        
        FAISS --> RAG: List[Document]
        deactivate FAISS
        
        RAG -> RAG: Build few-shot prompt\nwith context from chunks
        
        RAG -> LLM: Few-shot prompt +\ncontext + user query
        activate LLM
        
        LLM --> RAG: Generated answer
        deactivate LLM
        
        RAG --> Logger: {answer, sources,\nsource_documents}
        deactivate RAG
        
    else Empty index / No relevant chunks
        Index --> FAISS: Empty result
        deactivate Index
        
        FAISS --> RAG: []
        deactivate FAISS
        
        note right of RAG
            No context available
            for the question
        end note
        
        RAG -> LLM: Few-shot prompt +\nno context + user query
        activate LLM
        
        LLM --> RAG: "I don't know" or\n"not enough information"
        deactivate LLM
        
        RAG --> Logger: {answer: "I don't know",\nsources: [], source_documents: []}
        deactivate RAG
    end
    
    Logger -> Logger: Evaluate success:\n- Check for "I don't know"\n- Check answer length\n- Determine success flag
    
    Logger -> Log: Append JSONL entry:\n{timestamp, query,\nchunks_found, success, ...}
    
    Logger --> Eval: {answer, sources,\nsource_documents, log}
    deactivate Logger
    
    Eval -> Eval: Compare actual_success\nwith expected_success\n+ Check keywords\n+ Check sources
    
end

Eval -> Eval: Calculate statistics:\n- Accuracy\n- Failed questions\n- Source mismatches

Eval -> Report: Save evaluation report\n(JSON format)

Eval --> User: Print report:\n- Accuracy\n- Failed cases\n- Recommendations

deactivate Eval

note over Index
  **Failure Points:**
  
  1. **Empty FAISS Index**
     - No files in knowledge_base/
     - Index not built
  
  2. **Invalid/Empty Chunks**
     - Chunking failed
     - Document parsing errors
  
  3. **Ollama Unavailable**
     - Service not running
     - Network timeout
  
  4. **Low Relevance**
     - Query embedding mismatch
     - Wrong embedding model
end note

@enduml
